    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. But looking at it more broadly, some people argue that the 'moral imperative' argument is actually quite selfish because it ignores the actual suffering of citizens here at home. Do you think their perspective has any valid points, or is it just a way to avoid global responsibility?",
